(text "BATMAN / LiFePO4 8S + lead-acid 24 V" (at 25 25 0) (effects (font (size 2.54 2.54)) (justify left)) (uuid e6c0c10c-beb8-585e-954e-392560afb031))
(text "Four PCBs: A ESP + two I2C ports, B analog filters, C 3V3 distribution, D 5V distribution.\nTwo external ADS1115: analog from B, power/I2C from A. B.Cu only; WC = external cables.\nLOAD bus C1/C2 stay externally wired. Prototype: verify sensor model, fit and current budgets." (at 25 40 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid 6356677c-5429-59db-8864-743239021d9c))
